      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T02:27:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at the javadoc of `EthernetNetworkUpdateRequest`\n```\n/**\n * Represents a request to update an existing Ethernet interface.\n *\n * @see EthernetManager#updateConfiguration\n *\n * @hide\n */\n```\n`EthernetNetworkUpdateRequest` is used for updating ethernet interface in `updateConfiguration`, but the proposed `EthernetConfiguration` will also be used internally as a unified class to store Ethernet related configurations.\n\nIn the new proposal (see go/android-eth-config-store)\nthe updateConfiguration will add a new method that uses EthernetCOnfiguration for updating.\n```\n    public void updateConfiguration(\n            @NonNull EthernetPort port,\n            @NonNull EthernetConfiguration config,\n            @Nullable @CallbackExecutor Executor executor,\n            @Nullable OutcomeReceiver\u003cString, EthernetNetworkManagementException\u003e callback)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "aab107a6_55cee7a3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "e180735220b139248101f1ea95a9658d82a1cc10",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
